=== Editor Contrib - Block Comment Command > empty selection wraps itself
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":"!@#","blockComment":["<0","0>"]}
text: "first\n\tsecond line\nthird line\nfourth line\nfifth"
setSelections 1 3 1 3
cmd editor.action.blockComment
expectText "fi<0  0>rst\n\tsecond line\nthird line\nfourth line\nfifth"
expectSel 1 6 1 6

=== Editor Contrib - Block Comment Command > invisible selection ignored
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":"!@#","blockComment":["<0","0>"]}
